    "The survival_5k mean gain of +57.8% is inflated by seed 999, which the benchmark gated to zero at baseline. Across the four seeds that were already valid the mean is 643.70 -> 837.98 (+30.2%); seed 999 goes from invalid to valid, which is a repair rather than a score.",
